.env
.Renviron
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store
.browser/
renv/library/
renv/sandbox/
renv/staging/
data/prices/*
!data/prices/.gitkeep
data/companies.csv
data/earnings.csv
data/scraper-status.csv
data/earnings-summaries/*
!data/earnings-summaries/.gitkeep
data/news/*
!data/news/.gitkeep
reports/drafts/*
!reports/drafts/.gitkeep
# A final keeps its snapshot and the three input copies in Git — those are the record
# the next report compares against. The rendered report itself stays local, in either
# format, along with the chart images the Markdown copy refers to: they are large,
# partly binary, and reproducible from what is committed. Listing what to keep rather
# than what to drop means a new output file is excluded by default.
reports/final/*/*
!reports/final/*/snapshot.csv
!reports/final/*/report.md
!reports/final/*/companies.md
!reports/final/*/settings.md
!reports/final/*/manifest.md


/.quarto/
data/strategy-narrative.md
